ase\"><strong>Join the Movement: AI for Social Good&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h1>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-973128ee wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0\">\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-b4f8f71d66e810752c9e51a8ad419784 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">At <strong>AI Innovation and Inclusion Initiative (A4I)<\/strong>, we bring together a multidisciplinary team of researchers, engineers and changemakers united by a single purpose: solving society\u2019s most pressing challenges through responsible AI.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a strategic collaboration between <strong>Microsoft Philanthropies<\/strong> and <strong>International Institute of Information Technology Bangalore<\/strong>, A4I translates cutting-edge AI research into scalable Digital Public Goods that drive meaningful transformation across healthcare, education, agriculture, and accessibility.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When you join A4I, you become part of an open, impact-driven ecosystem, working alongside leading non-profit partners to design, build, and deploy AI solutions that empower underserved communities worldwide.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"f-20-16 wow wd wd_0.7s fadeInUp has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-e9b16a1787eb1351b320ca65eed4df48 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">Here, innovation meets inclusion, and technology becomes a force for equitable progress.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border wow wd wd_0.5s fadeInUp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" src=\"h